0324-negroni-wlan-smmu: Wi-Fi, an apps-SMMU stage-1 context for WLAN stream 0x1c01 (negroniwlan_smmu=3).
New bsd/dev/negroni_wlan_smmu.c: free context bank + stream-match entry (or the matching one, restored on
failure), 3-level 4 KiB tables, Android's IOVA window 0xa0000000 + 256 MiB (live.dts:20856); every chip
buffer mapped through negroni_wlan_dma_map; fault report and teardown on the failure path. Writes the apps
SMMU: owner approval before use. Panic fix 2026-10-26: SR/SW use negroni_mmio_rd32/wr32 (0255, no WZR
store, no writeback), contexts limited to 0x4e and SMRs to 0x78 (Android overrides). Details:
patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0324".

